DEF 14A filed by COLB on 2023-04-06

Item 1. : Election of 14 nominees to serve on the Board until the 2024 Annual Meeting of Shareholders or until their successors have been qualified and elected or there is a decrease in the number of directors;

Item 2. : Advisory (non-binding) vote on the compensation of Columbia’s named executive officers;

Item 3. : Advisory (non-binding) vote on the frequency of future advisory votes on executive compensation; and

Item 4. : Ratification (non-binding) of the appointment of Deloitte as the Company’s independent registered public accounting firm for the fiscal year ending December 31, 2023.
